description	"BX-series Commando Droid

Agile units with highly adaptive processors.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee

^5Powers:
- Hydraulic Legs (Jump 1)

^8Attributes:
- Battery Recharge (3)
- BP-Free Jumps
- 20% less knockback taken
- 25% slower skill cooldown

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Flipkick (1) ^3[Contact Jump]"